Rule 7     statement -> FOR LPAREN statement COMMA expression COMMA statement RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
Rule 8     statement -> SET_REG_8BIT LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 9     statement -> SET_REG_16BIT LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 10    statement -> SET_REG_32BIT LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 11    statement -> START LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 12    statement -> STOP LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 13    statement -> STOP_RAMP LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 14    statement -> STOP_START LPAREN RPAREN
Rule 15    statement -> POS_RAMP LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 16    statement -> SPD_RAMP LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 17    statement -> TORQ_RAMP LPAREN expression COMMA expression RPAREN
Rule 18    statement -> expression
